# Keep the Cloud Build upload lean and free of local state.
#
# ★ The Dockerfile copies exactly two things — NuGet.config and src/ — so everything else here is upload time
#   spent on files the build never opens. This list had been trimming bin/obj since it was written and the upload
#   was still 394.8 MiB / 7326 files (S112), because the weight was somewhere nobody had looked: the ANDROID
#   Gradle output, 383 MB of it in android/app/build alone. Excluding a build's own outputs is not enough when a
#   second toolchain in the same repo keeps its own.
.git/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
*.user
.vs/
.idea/
scratchpad/

# The native app: its own toolchain, never built by the container.
android/

# Not copied by the Dockerfile either — tests, dev tooling, docs and deploy scripts.
tests/
tools/
docs/
deploy/
